{"meta": {"limit": 100, "next": null, "offset": 0, "previous": null, "total_count": 12}, "objects": [{"abstract": "   This memo defines several new ciphersuites for the Transport Layer\n   Security (TLS) protocol to support certificate-less, secure\n   authentication using only a simple, low-entropy, password.  The\n   ciphersuites are all based on an authentication and key exchange\n   protocol that is resistant to off-line dictionary attack.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-pwd/", "expires": "2013-08-19T19:50:32Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 40168, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-pwd", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 24, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/40168/", "rev": "00", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/nomcom-chair@ietf.org/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2013-02-15T20:50:32Z", "title": "Secure Password Ciphersuites for Transport Layer Security (TLS)", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This memo defines several new ciphersuites for the Transport Layer\n   Security (TLS) protocol to support certificate-less, secure\n   authentication using only a simple, low-entropy, password.  The\n   ciphersuites are all based on an authentication and key exchange\n   protocol that is resistant to off-line dictionary attack.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-pwd/", "expires": "2014-02-16T22:50:14Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 46589, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-pwd", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 24, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/46589/", "rev": "01", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/nomcom-chair@ietf.o